    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Sm cell: platinum (cisplatin or carboplatin) plus a topoisomerase inhibitor, w or followed by immunotx; extensive stage: chemo plus atezolizumab or durvalumab."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Non-small cell, resectable: platinum doublet (cisplatin w vinorelbine, docetaxel or paclitaxel; carboplatin if cisplatin can't be used), ± immunotx."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Driver mut: targeted therapy first (osimertinib for EGFR; alectinib or lorlatinib for ALK; dabrafenib plus trametinib for BRAF)."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "⍉driver mut: chemo plus an immune checkpoint inhibitor (pembrolizumab, nivolumab, ipilimumab, cemiplimab, atezolizumab, durvalumab)."
     }
    ]
   }
  ]
 },
